Thom,

grep is part of OpenVMS POSIX.  This is a layered product that runs on any
version of OpenVMS starting with V5.5.  To see if it's installed on your system,
type POSIX at the DCL prompt.  If it's not, have the system manager install it.
The license to run POSIX is included with the OpenVMS license, and the software
kit is on the CD.

Paul


